      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>But that's the thing, though. It doesn't feel like a choice. It feels like I'm just watching a movie I've already seen. My family... we have this pattern. It's not just bad luck, it's like a physical inevitability. Every time i think i'm \"improving,\" I just feel like I'm delaying the part where everything falls apart again. How can it be a choice if the chemistry in my brain is already rigged against me?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
